Restore the prequantized discrete-weight contract changed by TE #3613:
https://github.com/NVIDIA/TransformerEngine/commit/aac5cb4abb470bf7c73028a7e2545bb6abb76b23

MCore FSDPv2 gathers MXFP8 rowwise planes for forward, then columnwise planes
before backward. Enabling columnwise usage during forward makes quantize_weight
request unavailable data. Preserve the parameter's quantizer usage, matching
TE's ordinary Linear. Leave single_grouped_weight and unquantized weights intact.

Applies to NVIDIA/TransformerEngine d05e4b83f3da7035e0bfae2d635608be86829bed.
